      "text": "Fig. 5. A : real-time RT-PCR of ﬁbrillin-1 mRNA. Standard curves for ﬁbrillin-1 and ribosomal protein S16 were assessed by real-time RT-PCR ( insets representing dilution curves). B : quantiﬁcation of myocardial ﬁbrillin-1/S16 mRNA content expressed as n -fold increase relative to control animals (run in duplicate). n   6–10 (rats) or 3 (mice) per group, respectively. Ct, control. * P   0.05 vs. control animals.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
